{"title":"a jellyfish for floating in the dark","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-jellyfish-for-floating-in-the-dark","date":1755596340000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beaad0dc-8a18-46cc-b19a-24a01a259b8b/jelly3.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beaad0dc-8a18-46cc-b19a-24a01a259b8b/jelly3.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beaad0dc-8a18-46cc-b19a-24a01a259b8b/jelly3.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beaad0dc-8a18-46cc-b19a-24a01a259b8b/jelly3.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beaad0dc-8a18-46cc-b19a-24a01a259b8b/jelly3.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beaad0dc-8a18-46cc-b19a-24a01a259b8b/jelly3.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beaad0dc-8a18-46cc-b19a-24a01a259b8b/jelly3.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beaad0dc-8a18-46cc-b19a-24a01a259b8b/jelly3.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n          <figcaption>\n            <p>white + colored pencil on black paper </p>\n          </figcaption>\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><em>visual art</em></a><em> | </em><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><em>sketchbook</em></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p>I’m dreaming of getting a jellyfish tattoo this scorpio season — a birthday gift to myself. the night after I drew <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-raven-waiting-for-a-storm\" target=\"_blank\">my second raven</a>, I spent the evening listening to music, and drawing this on black paper. I was feeling… alone, lonely, uncertain, at a loss for what to make of my life — past, present, and future. it was one of those days when the ground beneath my feet doesn’t seem as unshakably solid as it once did, and I feel like I have no choice except to surrender, to float in the dark. </p><p>in previous years, I’ve written about relating to <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/being-in-china-makes-me-feel-like-a-jellyfish\" target=\"_blank\">jellyfish consciousness</a>, particularly while traveling, and my love of their luminescent, otherworldly beauty (see: <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/notes-on-a-jellyfish\" target=\"_blank\">notes on a jellyfish</a>). this was my first jellyfish on paper, which means it is another addition to my collection of spirit animal companions. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4205654c-86e1-4d0d-85b2-7324a63d6eea/jelly2.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"3436\"